{"name":"The Hundredths Key","slug":"glyph-hundredths-key","blurb":"On the census street, Quill carries the key toward the bracket lamp. The mark is Hundredths. Click the key and it lights. A touch does not keep a step. A step away from the lamp is not kept. A step is kept only when the gap shrinks. The page proves its own street law on load. Glyph: The Hundredths Key.","seal":"29a69021b421cea5962a82efb0f0030f6d75b77981fd58af4fd2ee8888ff19cf"}
